---
// The 36 holy days engraved on the calendar ring of Oxford HSM inv. 47869, resolved against the Sarum kalendar
// (Dickinson, Missale Sarum, 1861–83). Data: src/treatise-text/saints.json; one source link per row.
import saints from "../../treatise-text/saints.json";
---
<details class="st">
  <summary>The holy days on the calendar ring</summary>
  <p class="st-note">
    Chaucer's England kept the Julian calendar. In 1391 its dates ran eight days behind the Gregorian calendar we use today,
    so St Gregory's day, 12 March, fell on what we would call 20 March.
  </p>
  <div class="st-scroll" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Holy days table (scrolls sideways)">
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr><th scope="col">Engraved</th><th scope="col">Feast</th><th scope="col">Day (Julian)</th><th scope="col">Today's calendar</th><th scope="col">Letter</th><th scope="col">Source</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {saints.map((s) => (
          <tr>
            <td class="st-abbr">{s.abbr}</td>
            <td>{s.nameEn}<span class="st-lat"> · <i>{s.nameLatin}</i></span></td>
            <td>{s.julian}</td>
            <td>{s.gregorian1391}{s.abbr === "nati" ? " 1392" : ""}</td>
            <td class="st-letter">{s.letter}</td>
            <td><a href={s.source.url} rel="noopener">p. {s.source.page}</a></td>
          </tr>
        ))}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  <p class="st-src">
    Feasts identified from the Sarum kalendar in F. H. Dickinson (ed.), <i>Missale ad usum insignis et praeclarae ecclesiae Sarum</i>
    (Burntisland, 1861–83), pp. 17**–28**, printed from the Sarum Missal of 1497. Abbreviations, days and letters as engraved on the instrument.
  </p>
</details>
<style>
  .st { margin: 1rem 0 0.4rem; color: #e4e7f3; }
  .st summary { cursor: pointer; font: 600 0.78rem/1.4 var(--me-font, serif); letter-spacing: 0.22em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #f5dc9b; }
  .st summary:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #ecc978; outline-offset: 3px; }
  .st-note, .st-src { font: 0.9rem/1.5 var(--modern-font, serif); color: #cfd5ec; margin: 0.8rem 0; }
  .st-src { font-size: 0.8rem; }
  .st-scroll { overflow-x: auto; background: rgba(5, 8, 22, 0.92); border: 1px solid rgba(236, 201, 120, 0.25); border-radius: 0.4rem; }
  .st table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; font: 0.86rem/1.35 var(--modern-font, serif); }
  .st th { text-align: left; font-weight: 600; color: #f5dc9b; padding: 0.5rem 0.6rem; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(236, 201, 120, 0.35); white-space: nowrap; }
  .st td { padding: 0.4rem 0.6rem; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(167, 176, 212, 0.15); vertical-align: top; }
  .st-abbr { font-family: var(--me-font, serif); color: #f5dc9b; white-space: nowrap; }
  .st-letter { text-align: center; }
  .st-lat { color: #a9b2d6; }
  .st a { color: #cfdcff; }
  @media (max-width: 600px) { .st-lat { display: none; } }
</style>
